msgid "Habit of Exposure"
msgstr ""

#. max 1999 bytes
msgctxt "1"
msgid "Rani's second SG.\nA peculiar taste for leaving a certain area's skin exposed,\nwithout equipping a Mystic Code for protection.\nAn SG one step higher would be of wanting to be exposed―――\ncommonly referred to as an exhibitionist. What a shame.\n\nIt is unknown why she came to have this SG.\nThe alchemist who made Rani apparently wore an\nabsurdly tight miniskirt, but no one's ever seen inside.\nIt's likely that such a sacred #RUBS      Zettai Ryouiki#RUBEAbsolute Territory#REND\nhad some influence on her thought structure.\nThere's also the theory that the slogan Rani utters:\n\"[#RUBS    pants hakase nai#RUBEOFF WITH THE PANTS#REND] is anagram to [#RUBS     hakase pants nai#RUBEPROFESSOR NO PANTS#REND]?\"\n\n             ◆\n\nBut while they have intelligence, humans are still animals.\nNo matter how advanced civilization becomes,\nthey will admire the wildlife running through the savanna.\n\nThough Rani was made as an highly intelligent being,\nshe feels the fundamental beauty of \"the natural form\"\nas a human, etched into her soul.\n"
msgstr ""

